# needs enums.scm: an editable enum takes what is typed on return
# ("enum: 13pt") and a choice from its list ("enum: 12pt"); the enum of
# values of different widths is as wide as the widest (e0); the choice list
# scrolls (e5); the long enum at the bottom opens its list above itself,
# within the window (e3), which scrolls (e4), and an item is chosen in it
wait 6000
window Vue enums
snapshot e0
click 120 19
wait 300
key End
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
text 13pt
key Return
wait 500
snapshot e1
click 149 19
wait 500
snapshot e2
click 120 74
wait 500
snapshot e2b
click 105 500
wait 500
snapshot e3
move 105 300
wait 200
wheel 105 300 0 -5
wait 700
snapshot e4
click 100 300
wait 500
wheel 60 100 0 -3
wait 700
snapshot e5
